Cell["\<\
Self-consistently solves the multi-histogram equations for the free energies, \
returned as an association keyed by the same beta (or field) values.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->822687678,ExpressionUUID->"bffffc96-8aca-2043-be7e-15e0ca3df4df"]
}, Open  ]],

